<title>ESTONIA: KUUTSEMAE SKI RESORT TO ISSUE SHARES.</title>
<headline>KUUTSEMAE SKI RESORT TO ISSUE SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuutsemae skiing resort, based in southern Estonia, will issue 184,000 new shares in public, it said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The aim is to liven up our activity and expand the complex,&quot; the company's managing director Peeter Ilmas told Reuters.</p>
<p>The issue takes place between August 11-25 and the price of a 10-kroon par value share is 22 kroons.</p>
<p>Its present share capital is 2.28 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 62092 01, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
